1
00:00:44,444 --> 00:00:45,945
Where were you?

2
00:00:46,980 --> 00:00:48,481
Just out for a walk.

3
00:00:48,982 --> 00:00:49,649
That's all?

4
00:00:49,649 --> 00:00:51,317
What time do you want to work out today?

5
00:00:51,317 --> 00:00:52,719
Hmm...

6
00:00:53,186 --> 00:00:55,822
Can I take a break today?

7
00:00:55,989 --> 00:00:58,425
No, you barely worked out yesterday.
Take today off.

8
00:00:58,825 --> 00:01:00,126
Was yesterday tough for you?

9
00:01:00,593 --> 00:01:02,162
It's not that.

10
00:01:02,429 --> 00:01:03,430
Then let's just work out.

11
00:01:04,264 --> 00:01:05,565
Or am I making you uncomfortable?

12
00:01:05,965 --> 00:01:06,533
No.

13
00:01:07,133 --> 00:01:08,768
Then there's no reason not to do it.

14
00:01:10,470 --> 00:01:12,172
Alright, I'll do it.

15
00:01:12,405 --> 00:01:13,907
Change and come out.

16
00:01:13,907 --> 00:01:15,108
Okay.

17
00:02:00,120 --> 00:02:01,921
Please, don't do this.

18
00:02:06,726 --> 00:02:08,761
We're doing chest exercises today. Watch.

19
00:02:10,763 --> 00:02:12,832
Grip it so you feel it right in your chest.

20
00:02:13,533 --> 00:02:16,102
Do twelve reps per set,

21
00:02:16,803 --> 00:02:17,770
just like this.

22
00:02:24,344 --> 00:02:25,278
Like this?

23
00:02:25,879 --> 00:02:26,613
Nope.

24
00:02:28,081 --> 00:02:30,416
Up your chest, twist your arms more.

25
00:02:30,750 --> 00:02:31,451
One.

26
00:02:33,386 --> 00:02:33,987
Two.

27
00:02:38,191 --> 00:02:38,925
Okay, again.

28
00:02:41,060 --> 00:02:41,628
One.

29
00:02:43,129 --> 00:02:43,897
Two.

30
00:02:45,165 --> 00:02:47,267
Three. Feel it now?

31
00:02:49,035 --> 00:02:51,037
Good, Keep going.

32
00:02:53,806 --> 00:02:56,442
Remember, I said I'd give you
a free fitting last time.

33
00:02:56,910 --> 00:02:58,144
Yeah.

34
00:02:59,746 --> 00:03:02,015
Can I tell you something I want too?

35
00:03:03,082 --> 00:03:04,317
What is it?

36
00:03:06,986 --> 00:03:08,021
I want this.

37
00:03:10,089 --> 00:03:11,658
Is this real?

38
00:03:11,858 --> 00:03:13,726
Isn't this what you wanted?

39
00:04:28,501 --> 00:04:30,069
Do you want to try it on me?

40
00:04:30,703 --> 00:04:32,038
Me, on you?

41
00:04:32,071 --> 00:04:32,905
Yeah,

42
00:04:59,198 --> 00:05:00,633
Does this feel okay?

43
00:05:00,633 --> 00:05:02,168
Does it hurt?

44
00:05:02,168 --> 00:05:04,904
No, I'm okay. It feels good—keep going.

45
00:06:03,463 --> 00:06:05,264
(moan)

46
00:06:05,898 --> 00:06:07,200
I'm struggling.

47
00:06:07,266 --> 00:06:07,934
Okay,

48
00:06:08,034 --> 00:06:09,068
I can't do this more.

49
00:06:09,202 --> 00:06:10,303
Isn't it fucking good?

50
00:06:13,639 --> 00:06:17,009
Five. Oh, you came?
When did you get here?

51
00:06:17,343 --> 00:06:18,411
Oh,

52
00:06:18,444 --> 00:06:20,046
Working out?

53
00:06:20,646 --> 00:06:23,583
Yeah, I'm getting a free session. Wanna join?

54
00:06:24,083 --> 00:06:26,686
No, no,

55
00:06:27,720 --> 00:06:29,722
Keep going!

56
00:06:39,465 --> 00:06:42,468
Am I a horrible person?

57
00:06:52,845 --> 00:06:54,180
Hello?

58
00:06:54,380 --> 00:06:56,015
It's me, Yunsoo.

59
00:06:56,449 --> 00:06:58,785
Hey, why haven't you answered?

60
00:06:58,851 --> 00:06:59,819
Sorry.

61
00:06:59,852 --> 00:07:01,988
But I won't be able to contact you anymore.

62
00:07:02,155 --> 00:07:03,856
I called just to tell you this.

63
00:07:03,890 --> 00:07:04,524
Huh?

64
00:07:04,891 --> 00:07:06,058
What do you mean?

65
00:07:06,159 --> 00:07:08,227
Hey!

66
00:07:13,833 --> 00:07:16,369
This is the right decision, isn't it?

67
00:07:31,617 --> 00:07:34,787
What? Leaving?
Suddenly?

68
00:07:40,426 --> 00:07:41,694
But why all of a sudden?

69
00:07:41,694 --> 00:07:45,531
No idea, something urgent happened at home, I guess.

70
00:07:45,531 --> 00:07:47,467
He left in a rush at dawn.

71
00:07:48,968 --> 00:07:53,306
He said he's sorry for leaving without saying anything.

72
00:08:04,450 --> 00:08:07,086
I'm sorry for leaving so suddenly.

73
00:08:07,086 --> 00:08:09,956
I really enjoyed our time together,

74
00:08:09,956 --> 00:08:13,659
I really enjoyed our time together,
but right now

75
00:08:13,659 --> 00:08:16,796
I don't think I'm ready to meet someone new
or start anything.

76
00:08:17,497 --> 00:08:20,099
I need to find myself first.

77
00:08:20,533 --> 00:08:22,401
Take care of yourself too.

78
00:08:35,648 --> 00:08:39,519
I'm sad you had to leave like this,
but I respect your decision.

79
00:08:39,519 --> 00:08:42,255
Reach out whenever you're ready.

80
00:08:42,622 --> 00:08:46,058
If you want Persnol Traning,
Come by anytime.

81
00:08:55,368 --> 00:08:56,202
Tighten your core!

82
00:08:56,202 --> 00:08:57,270
I can't this anymore!

83
00:08:57,270 --> 00:08:59,005
Don't lose your form!

84
00:08:59,372 --> 00:09:00,907
Alright, that's enough.

85
00:09:05,611 --> 00:09:07,480
I don't want that!

86
00:09:07,480 --> 00:09:11,551
- You okay?
- I can't do this, it's just too hard.

87
00:09:58,000 --> 00:10:04,200
"Sharehouse Part.2"
